    <section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-mark">✳</span> CAREERFOLIO RESUME STUDIO</div><h1>Make your next<br>move look like<br><span>you mean it.</span></h1><p>Choose a polished layout, tell your story, and leave with a resume that is ready to send.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary hero-cta" href="#templates">Explore resume designs <span>↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#how-it-works">See how it works <span>↓</span></a></div><div class="hero-assurance"><span class="assurance-icon">✓</span><span>Made to customize</span><i></i><span>Export-ready layouts</span></div></div><div class="hero-visual"><div class="hero-orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="hero-orbit orbit-two"></div><div class="hero-note note-top"><span class="note-symbol">01</span><span><b>Start with a style</b><small>Choose a layout that fits your field</small></span></div><div class="hero-resume"><div class="hero-resume-top"><span class="hero-resume-mark">C</span><span class="hero-resume-lines"><i></i><i></i></span><span class="resume-live"><i></i> LIVE PREVIEW</span></div><div class="hero-resume-name">Your next chapter</div><div class="hero-resume-role">A resume that brings your experience forward</div><div class="hero-resume-contact"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><div class="hero-resume-section">EXPERIENCE</div><div class="hero-resume-entry"><span></span><i></i><i></i></div><div class="hero-resume-entry second"><span></span><i></i><i></i></div><div class="hero-resume-section education-label">EDUCATION & SKILLS</div><div class="hero-resume-skills"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="resume-page">01 <span>/ 01</span></div></div><div class="hero-note note-bottom"><span class="note-symbol purple">↗</span><span><b>Make it yours</b><small>Fine-tune every section and detail</small></span></div><div class="hero-caption">YOUR EXPERIENCE, YOUR NEXT CHAPTER <span>↗</span></div></div></section>

