    <section class="feature-section" id="features"><div class="section-intro"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-mark">✳</span> YOUR WORK, WELL PRESENTED</div><h2>Make every detail<br>work <span>together.</span></h2><p>A strong resume makes your experience easy to find and easy to understand. Careerfolio gives each part a clear place.</p></div><div class="feature-grid"><article class="feature-card feature-card-large"><div class="feature-number">01 / STRUCTURE</div><div class="feature-illustration structure-illustration"><span class="illustration-sidebar"></span><span class="illustration-page"><i></i><i></i><b></b><i></i><i></i><b></b><i></i></span><span class="illustration-check">✓</span></div><h3>A thoughtful structure</h3><p>Bring your profile, experience, skills, and education into one readable document.</p></article><article class="feature-card"><div class="feature-number">02 / CONTROL</div><div class="feature-illustration control-illustration"><span class="control-window"><i></i><i></i><b></b><i></i></span><span class="control-cursor">↗</span></div><h3>Your words, your way</h3><p>Edit every line yourself. Your resume stays grounded in your real work.</p></article><article class="feature-card"><div class="feature-number">03 / EXPORT</div><div class="feature-illustration export-illustration"><span class="export-sheet"><i></i><i></i><b></b><i></i></span><span class="export-arrow">↓</span></div><h3>Ready to send</h3><p>Preview your page and print or save a PDF whenever you’re ready.</p></article></div></section>

    <section class="ats-section" id="how-it-works"><div class="ats-copy"><div class="eyebrow light-eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-mark">✳</span> BUILT FOR CLARITY</div><h2>Easy for people<br>to read. <span>Ready for<br>the next step.</span></h2><p>Keep your information in a familiar order with distinct headings, readable type, and a simple page layout. Your experience stays easy to scan from the first glance to the last.</p><a class="button button-light" href="#templates">Choose your layout <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="ats-visual"><div class="ats-window"><div class="ats-window-head"><span class="window-dot"></span><span class="window-dot"></span><span class="window-dot"></span><span class="window-title">CAREERFOLIO / PREVIEW</span></div><div class="ats-lines"><span class="ats-heading-line"></span><span class="ats-subline"></span><span class="ats-rule"></span><span class="ats-section-label">EXPERIENCE</span><span class="ats-long"></span><span class="ats-medium"></span><span class="ats-short"></span><span class="ats-section-label second-label">SKILLS</span><span class="ats-tags"><i>Research</i><i>Strategy</i><i>Design</i></span></div><div class="ats-ready"><span>✓</span> Clear hierarchy</div></div><div class="ats-side-label">SIMPLE BY DESIGN <span>·</span> MADE TO SHARE</div></div></section>

